[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486595361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99343#issuecomment-2486595361","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99343","id":2486595361,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UNm8h","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T19:39:59Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T19:39:59Z","body":"Hi, thanks for the report!\n\nYou're using XWayland, the X11 compatibility layer for Wayland, which is known to be a bit funky at places.\n\nFor the time being I'd recommend running the editor in single-window mode, either through the `--single-window` CLI parameter or the relevant editor setting `interface/editor/single_window_mode`.\n\nThere's also an **experimental** native Wayland backend[^1] which might give you better luck (or not :P) but note that it has still some limitations, like single-window-mode only for now (I'm trying to work on it but I'm quite busy lately).\n\n[^1]: https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-3-dev-3/#wayland-support-for-linux","author